  <Overview>Enshrouded dedicated server (mornedhels/enshrouded-server). Updates the game on a schedule but only while nobody is online, zips the world to the backup share every 6 hours, and restarts daily at 05:00 when empty. Access is by server role: set the Admin and Friends passwords before the first start.</Overview>
  <Category>GameServers:</Category>
  <Requires>Forward UDP 15637 on your router to this server. Keep appdata on an SSD pool: the game is several GB and an update briefly needs twice that. Plan on 16 GB RAM and 4+ cores for the server alone. The first start downloads the game and takes a while; watch the log.</Requires>
  <WebUI/>
  <ExtraParams>--stop-timeout=90 --memory=16g --security-opt=no-new-privileges=true --cap-drop=ALL --cap-add=CHOWN --cap-add=DAC_OVERRIDE --cap-add=SETUID --cap-add=SETGID --cap-add=KILL</ExtraParams>
  <PostArgs/>
  <CPUset/>
  <Changes>
### 2026-10-16
- Pin upstream dev builds by digest: stable 1.7.2 fails on Enshrouded 1.0 (Steamworks Version Mismatch, upstream #254) and its backups skip 1.0 saves (#256). Move back to stable once upstream releases.
- First version.
  </Changes>
  <Config Name="Query port" Target="15637" Default="15637" Mode="udp" Description="Steam query port. Keep host and container port the same and equal to SERVER_QUERYPORT: the server advertises this number." Type="Port" Display="always" Required="true" Mask="false">15637</Config>
  <Config Name="Server data" Target="/opt/enshrouded" Default="/mnt/user/appdata/enshrouded" Mode="rw" Description="Game install, enshrouded_server.json (contains role passwords) and the world save under server/savegame." Type="Path" Display="always" Required="true" Mask="false">/mnt/user/appdata/enshrouded</Config>
  <Config Name="Backups" Target="/backups" Default="/mnt/user/backup/enshrouded" Mode="rw" Description="World backups (zip) written by BACKUP_CRON. Point Duplicati at this folder for off-site copies." Type="Path" Display="always" Required="true" Mask="false">/mnt/user/backup/enshrouded</Config>
